OL,3,CLive updates as Hull funeral director
OL,4,Csentenced over unburied bodies and
OL,5,Cashes
OL,7,FWarning: Article may contain
OL,8,Fdistressing details
OL,10,FA disgraced funeral director is facing
OL,11,Fjail after the discovery of unburied
OL,12,Fbodies and ashes at a funeral parlour
OL,13,Fin Hull.
OL,15,FRobert Bush is due to learn his fate
OL,16,Fthis week in a case which sent
OL,17,Fshockwaves through the nation and led
OL,18,Fto calls for tougher regulations
OL,19,Facross the funeral industry.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/4
