OL,3,CLive updates as Hull funeral director
OL,4,Csentenced over unburied bodies and
OL,5,Cashes
OL,7,FThe 47-year-old admitted 67 charges,
OL,8,Fincluding preventing a lawful and
OL,9,Fdecent burial and fraud. The charges
OL,10,Frelate to the discovery of remains at
OL,11,Fhis business on Hessle Road in city
OL,12,Fback in early 2024, when concerns were
OL,13,Fraised about ongoing practices.
OL,15,FBush was initially due to be tried
OL,16,Flater this year, but pleaded guilty in
OL,17,FApril to 30 counts of preventing a
OL,18,Fburial and more than 30 fraud charges,
OL,19,Fas well as theft.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/4
