OL,3,CLive updates as Hull funeral director
OL,4,Csentenced over unburied bodies and
OL,5,Cashes
OL,7,FSentencing gets underway on Monday at
OL,8,FHull Crown Court and is due to last
OL,9,Ffor five days.
OL,11,FThe hearing is due to begin from
OL,12,F10.30am - there is live coverage from
OL,13,Fthe courtroom below.
OL,15,FMonday, 27 July
OL,17,FHuge interest in case
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/4
