OL,3,CLive updates as Hull funeral director
OL,4,Csentenced over unburied bodies and
OL,5,Cashes
OL,7,FWe're live in court today for the
OL,8,Fsentencing of Robert Bush. The level
OL,9,Fof interest in this case is such that
OL,10,Fmany members of the media need to sit
OL,11,Fin an overspill court. The sentencing
OL,12,Fis listed to run for five days.
